  "solution": "Explanation:\n\nThe pattern followed in the given sets is:**\n **(**Second term - Third term) + 200 = First term**\n\nNow we apply the pattern on the given sets:\n\n(241 ,230, 189)\n\n__**(230 - 189)**__ + 200 = 241\n\n__**41 + 200**__ = 241 \n\n241 = 241\n\n(218, 250, 232)\n\n__(250 - 232)__ + 200 = 218\n\n__18 + 200__ = 218\n\n218 = 218\n\nNow we apply the pattern on the given options:\n\nOption 1) (158, 194, 182)\n\n__(194 - 182)__ + 200 = 158\n__12 + 200__ = 158\n212 ≠ 158\n\nOption 2) (197, 233, 190)\n\n__(233 - 190)__ + 200 = 197\n__43 + 200__ = 197\n243 ≠ 197\n\nOption 3) (276, 260, 184)\n\n__(260 - 184)__ + 200 = 276\n__76 + 200__ = 276\n276 = 276\n\nOption 4) (174, 212, 166)\n\n__(212 - 166)__ + 200 = 174\n__46 + 200__ = 174\n246 ≠ 174\n\nHence **the correct answer is option 3.**",
